<title>BRAZIL: Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended September 08 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>    Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p>	    08/09/96     01/09/96     10/09/95</p>
<p> Bean	193,100	 18,300	214,000</p>
<p> Meal	171,200	235,000	116,800</p>
<p> Oil	  32,400	 77,000	 25,000</p>
</text>
